{"id":"81480d7037b244c8","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/908_分离逻辑资源片段.md","title":"908 分离逻辑资源片段","display":"908_分离逻辑资源片段","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"908-分离逻辑资源片段\">908 分离逻辑资源片段</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始数据与断言构造子\">1. 原始数据与断言构造子</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Loc}=\\{\\ell_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Val}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Loc}=\\{\\ell_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Val}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>断言构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{emp},\\operatorname{pt},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{emp},\\operatorname{pt},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{emp},\\operatorname{pt},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand}\">\\(\\operatorname{emp},\\operatorname{pt},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand}\\)</span> 六个构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{emp}\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pt}:\\mathsf{Loc}\\times\\mathsf{Val}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{emp}\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pt}:\\mathsf{Loc}\\times\\mathsf{Val}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand}:\n\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand}:\n\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v)\">\\(\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v)\\)</span> 是点到断言。该片段的目标特征是后承关系由有限偏函数资源和部分合成直接定义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-断言、自由位置与值替换\">2. 断言、自由位置与值替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{emp}\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{emp}\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\mathsf{Loc},v\\in\\mathsf{Val}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell\\in\\mathsf{Loc},v\\in\\mathsf{Val}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{and}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{and}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{or}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{or}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{star}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{star}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由位置函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FL}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Loc})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FL}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Loc})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{emp})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{emp})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v))=\\{\\ell\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v))=\\{\\ell\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{and}(P,Q))=\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{or}(P,Q))=\\operatorname{FL}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FL}(Q),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{and}(P,Q))=\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{or}(P,Q))=\\operatorname{FL}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FL}(Q),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{star}(P,Q))=\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q))=\\operatorname{FL}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FL}(Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{star}(P,Q))=\\operatorname{FL}(\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q))=\\operatorname{FL}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FL}(Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由值出现函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{emp})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{emp})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v))=\\{v\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v))=\\{v\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{and}(P,Q))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{or}(P,Q))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{star}(P,Q))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{and}(P,Q))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{or}(P,Q))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{star}(P,Q))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q))\n=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V}(Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{Val}\\to\\mathsf{Val}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{Val}\\to\\mathsf{Val}\\)</span>，定义值替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VSub}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\times\\mathsf{Val}^{\\mathsf{Val}}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VSub}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\times\\mathsf{Val}^{\\mathsf{Val}}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VSub}(P,\\theta)=P[\\theta]\">\\(\\operatorname{VSub}(P,\\theta)=P[\\theta]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{emp}[\\theta]=\\operatorname{emp},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{emp}[\\theta]=\\operatorname{emp},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v)[\\theta]=\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,\\theta(v)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v)[\\theta]=\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,\\theta(v)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(P,Q)[\\theta]=\\operatorname{and}(P[\\theta],Q[\\theta]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(P,Q)[\\theta]=\\operatorname{and}(P[\\theta],Q[\\theta]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(P,Q)[\\theta]=\\operatorname{or}(P[\\theta],Q[\\theta]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{or}(P,Q)[\\theta]=\\operatorname{or}(P[\\theta],Q[\\theta]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{star}(P,Q)[\\theta]=\\operatorname{star}(P[\\theta],Q[\\theta]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{star}(P,Q)[\\theta]=\\operatorname{star}(P[\\theta],Q[\\theta]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q)[\\theta]=\\operatorname{wand}(P[\\theta],Q[\\theta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q)[\\theta]=\\operatorname{wand}(P[\\theta],Q[\\theta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该断言语言没有绑定构造子。定义有限位置集、绑定名函数与新位置选择函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Loc})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Loc}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Loc})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Loc}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Loc}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(P)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Loc}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(P)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshLoc}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Loc})\\to\\mathsf{Loc},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshLoc}(F)\\notin F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshLoc}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Loc})\\to\\mathsf{Loc},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshLoc}(F)\\notin F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一位置重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{Loc}\\to\\mathsf{Loc}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{Loc}\\to\\mathsf{Loc}\\)</span>，定义捕获避免位置重命名</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\times\\mathsf{Loc}^{\\mathsf{Loc}}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\times\\mathsf{Loc}^{\\mathsf{Loc}}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{emp},\\rho)=\\operatorname{emp},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{emp},\\rho)=\\operatorname{emp},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v),\\rho)=\\operatorname{pt}(\\rho(\\ell),v),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v),\\rho)=\\operatorname{pt}(\\rho(\\ell),v),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{and}(P,Q),\\rho)=\n\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(P,\\rho),\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(Q,\\rho)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{and}(P,Q),\\rho)=\n\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(P,\\rho),\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(Q,\\rho)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{or}(P,Q),\\rho)=\n\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(P,\\rho),\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(Q,\\rho)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{or}(P,Q),\\rho)=\n\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(P,\\rho),\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(Q,\\rho)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{star}(P,Q),\\rho)=\n\\operatorname{star}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(P,\\rho),\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(Q,\\rho)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{star}(P,Q),\\rho)=\n\\operatorname{star}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(P,\\rho),\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(Q,\\rho)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q),\\rho)=\n\\operatorname{wand}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(P,\\rho),\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(Q,\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q),\\rho)=\n\\operatorname{wand}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(P,\\rho),\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(Q,\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为句法相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q\\Longleftrightarrow P=Q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q\\Longleftrightarrow P=Q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VSub}\">\\(\\operatorname{VSub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\)</span> 均不产生捕获。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-有限资源与部分合成\">3. 有限资源与部分合成</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Heap}\">\\(\\mathsf{Heap}\\)</span> 是所有有限偏函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathsf{Loc}\\rightharpoonup_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Val}\">\\(h:\\mathsf{Loc}\\rightharpoonup_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Val}\\)</span> 的集合。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(h)=\\{\\ell\\in\\mathsf{Loc}:\\exists v\\in\\mathsf{Val}\\,(h(\\ell)=v)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(h)=\\{\\ell\\in\\mathsf{Loc}:\\exists v\\in\\mathsf{Val}\\,(h(\\ell)=v)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>空堆 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing_h\">\\(\\varnothing_h\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\varnothing_h)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(\\varnothing_h)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>分离谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\# k\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(k)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\# k\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(k)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>部分合成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{(h,k):h\\# k\\}\">\\(\\{(h,k):h\\# k\\}\\)</span>，并且当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\# k\">\\(h\\# k\\)</span> 时</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(h\\oplus k)=\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(k),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(h\\oplus k)=\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(k),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\Rightarrow(h\\oplus k)(\\ell)=h(\\ell),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\Rightarrow(h\\oplus k)(\\ell)=h(\\ell),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\operatorname{dom}(k)\\Rightarrow(h\\oplus k)(\\ell)=k(\\ell).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell\\in\\operatorname{dom}(k)\\Rightarrow(h\\oplus k)(\\ell)=k(\\ell).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该条目的语义结构载体对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}=(\\mathsf{Heap},\\varnothing_h,\\operatorname{dom},\\#,\\oplus).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}=(\\mathsf{Heap},\\varnothing_h,\\operatorname{dom},\\#,\\oplus).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-满足关系\">4. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Heap}\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Heap}\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\)</span> 为满足下列递归子句的最小关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{emp}\\Longleftrightarrow h=\\varnothing_h,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{emp}\\Longleftrightarrow h=\\varnothing_h,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(h)=\\{\\ell\\}\\wedge h(\\ell)=v,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(h)=\\{\\ell\\}\\wedge h(\\ell)=v,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{and}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\nh\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\wedge h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{and}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\nh\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\wedge h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{or}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\nh\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\vee h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{or}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\nh\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\vee h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{star}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists h_0,h_1\\in\\mathsf{Heap}\\,\n(h_0\\# h_1\\wedge h=h_0\\oplus h_1\\wedge h_0\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\wedge h_1\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{star}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists h_0,h_1\\in\\mathsf{Heap}\\,\n(h_0\\# h_1\\wedge h=h_0\\oplus h_1\\wedge h_0\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\wedge h_1\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathsf{Heap}\\,(h\\# k\\wedge k\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\Rightarrow h\\oplus k\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\operatorname{wand}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathsf{Heap}\\,(h\\# k\\wedge k\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\Rightarrow h\\oplus k\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-语义后承\">5. 语义后承</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall h\\in\\mathsf{Heap}\\,((\\forall Q\\in\\Gamma\\,h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q)\\Rightarrow h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall h\\in\\mathsf{Heap}\\,((\\forall Q\\in\\Gamma\\,h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q)\\Rightarrow h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义语义后承关系对象</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ent}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\Gamma,P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ent}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\Gamma,P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-资源等价\">6. 资源等价</h1>\n<p>定义资源等价</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\{P\\}\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q\\wedge\\{Q\\}\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\{P\\}\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q\\wedge\\{Q\\}\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-反证书\">7. 反证书</h1>\n<p>反证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctr}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\Gamma,P)=\n\\{h\\in\\mathsf{Heap}:\\forall Q\\in\\Gamma\\,h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q\\ \\wedge\\ \\neg(h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ctr}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\Gamma,P)=\n\\{h\\in\\mathsf{Heap}:\\forall Q\\in\\Gamma\\,h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}Q\\ \\wedge\\ \\neg(h\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ctr}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\Gamma,P)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ctr}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\Gamma,P)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目选择纯语义实现，不把“valid”记号冒充有限证明对象。定义有效判断集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,P)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}})\n\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}:\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,P)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}})\n\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}:\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,P)\\in\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Ctr}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\Gamma,P)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}}P\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,P)\\in\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Ctr}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}(\\Gamma,P)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>该条目为纯语义资源模型。资源差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\n=(\\mathsf{Heap},\\varnothing_h,\\#,\\oplus,\n\\operatorname{pt},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\mathsf{Ctr}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\n=(\\mathsf{Heap},\\varnothing_h,\\#,\\oplus,\n\\operatorname{pt},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\mathsf{Ctr}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{SLR}}=(\\mathsf{Loc},\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\operatorname{FL},\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V},\\operatorname{VSub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshLoc},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\mathsf{Heap},\\operatorname{dom},\\#,\\oplus,\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\operatorname{Ent}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\mathsf{Ctr}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{SLR}}=(\\mathsf{Loc},\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\operatorname{FL},\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf V},\\operatorname{VSub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshLoc},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\mathsf{Heap},\\operatorname{dom},\\#,\\oplus,\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\models_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\operatorname{Ent}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\mathsf{Ctr}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义资源片段的断言语言、有限堆资源、满足关系和语义后承；不含程序语句、Hoare 三元组或证明演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"908-分离逻辑资源片段","text":"908 分离逻辑资源片段","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始数据与断言构造子","text":"1. 原始数据与断言构造子","level":1},{"id":"2.-断言、自由位置与值替换","text":"2. 断言、自由位置与值替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-有限资源与部分合成","text":"3. 有限资源与部分合成","level":1},{"id":"4.-满足关系","text":"4. 满足关系","level":1},{"id":"5.-语义后承","text":"5. 语义后承","level":1},{"id":"6.-资源等价","text":"6. 资源等价","level":1},{"id":"7.-反证书","text":"7. 反证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Loc}=\\{\\ell_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Val}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{emp},\\operatorname{pt},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{emp},\\operatorname{pt},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{emp}\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pt}:\\mathsf{Loc}\\times\\mathsf{Val}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{wand}:\n\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{emp}\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell\\in\\mathsf{Loc},v\\in\\mathsf{Val}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{pt}(\\ell,v)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},","display":true},{"tex":"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{and}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},","display":true},{"tex":"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{or}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}},","display":true},{"tex":"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{SLR}}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{star}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{\\mathsf{S